„­bible_version£KJV¤book-§chapter¨sectionsœ…¤book-§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙMoreover, brethren, I declare unto you the gospel which I preached unto you, which also ye have received, and wherein ye stand;¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙkby which also ye are saved, if ye keep in memory what I preached unto you, unless ye have believed in vain.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book-§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses–„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ€For I delivered unto you first of all that which I also received, how that Christ died for our sins according to the scriptures;¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙYand that he was buried, and that he rose again the third day according to the scriptures:¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ3and that he was seen of Cephas, then of the twelve:¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙafter that, he was seen of above five hundred brethren at once; of whom the greater part remain unto this present, but some are fallen asleep.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ;After that, he was seen of James; then of all the apostles.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙGAnd last of all he was seen of me also, as of one born out of due time.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book-§chapter«first_verse	ªlast_verse¦verses“„¥verse	¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙuFor I am the least of the apostles, that am not meet to be called an apostle, because I persecuted the church of God.¦layout ªlast_verse	„¥verse
